;;;;
;;;; The DYLAN module's variables whose values are in C: the built-in
;;;; classes (classes.lisp), and the functions written in C -- a few the
;;;; manual calls methods, which programs cannot extend, and the %
;;;; primitives the library (runtime/dylan) is written on.  Everything else
;;;; of the DYLAN module is defined by the library.

(in-package #:dylan-compiler)

